 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/Kconfig           |   8 +
 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-ipq9650.c | 430 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 439 insertions(+)

